sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-morphometric-validation> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Hamant et al. (2008), Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Uyttewaal et al. (2012), Heisler et al. (2010) & Louveaux et al. (2016) shoot apical meristem shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, katanin boundary morphogenesis and PIN1/CMT co-alignment on a growing L1 cellular vertex mesh — Morphometric validation: 60/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Credited: `measure_morphoeval` (L1344-1519) now returns 16 measurements; the 7 Pass 3 entries (L1451-1518) are emergent quantities computed on the mesh — PIN1-wall/CMT co-alignment with bot1 and oryzalin controls, PIN1 away-from-wound fraction WT vs oryzalin, wound-ring CMT cos^2 with the oryzalin null, division-plane alignment with the Errera-only counterfactual (1.00 vs 0.18), Euler residual, the 3-point katanin sweep r and the zone-S RMSE (0.24, which exposes the dome over-prediction rather than hiding it) — each with a stated method, a reference and a random null. Deductions: the legacy 'Bozorg stress cue vs strain-cue correlation r = 0.991 / -0.415' (L1397-1405) is a literal constant copied from the reference JSON at L420 and L426 and reported as a measurement with reference 0.991 — circular (-12); the 5-condition depth Pearson r = 0.9992 (L1424-1432) correlates closed-form fits against the very JSON they were fitted to (-8); two specimen measurements set reference_value equal to the measured value (L1438, L1447) (-4); the new Heisler / Louveaux references are ordinal 0.75 thresholds, not digitised figure values, and the WT co-alignment (0.747) sits just under that threshold (-6); the vertex-mesh S values differ from the zone references by up to 0.34 (dome) (-4)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py L1397–L1405: 'Principal stress cue r = 0.991 vs strain-cue r = -0.415' measurement is the literal emp_r constant from L420/L426, not a computed correlation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py#L1397-L1405>",
            "2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py L1424–L1432: 5-condition Pearson r compares fitted closed forms with the reference JSON they were fitted to <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py#L1424-L1432>",
            "2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py L1438–L1447: Specimen coherency and area-fraction measurements use reference_value = value (self-referential) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py#L1438-L1447>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-5-condition-perturbation-morphospace-boundary-depth-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-arabidopsis-sam-specimen-saddle-boundary-vs-central-dome-structure-tensor-coherency>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-arabidopsis-sam-specimen-segmented-tissue-area-fraction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-bozorg-et-al-2014-principal-stress-cue-vs-strain-cue-control-alignment-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-euler-characteristic-residual-chi-after-chi-before-over-all-vertex-mesh-topological-events-divisions-t1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-heisler-2010-fraction-of-wound-ring-cells-with-pin1-polarity-directed-away-from-the-ablated-cell-wt-vs-oryzalin>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-heisler-2010-pin1-rich-wall-axis-vs-cmt-director-co-alignment-cos-2-on-the-growing-saddle-boundary-l1-vertex-mesh-wt>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-law-1-saddle-boundary-stress-amplification-algebraic-residual>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-law-2-law-3-cylinder-laplace-switch-and-katanin-oryzalin-stiffness-residual>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-louveaux-2016-division-plane-alignment-with-local-sigma-1-in-the-saddle-boundary-stress-rule-vs-errera-shortest-wall-prediction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-organ-meristem-saddle-boundary-k-0-vs-central-dome-k-0-cmt-nematic-order-s>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-single-cell-laser-ablation-ring-circumferential-cmt-alignment-cos-2-delta-theta>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-vertex-mesh-katanin-gain-sweep-saddle-cmt-order-s-at-gamma-mt-0-0-45-2-40-vs-reference-boundary-s-pearson-r>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-vertex-mesh-zone-cmt-order-s-dome-saddle-stem-rmse-vs-hamant-2008-reference-s>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-wild-type-vs-bot1-ktn1-katanin-mutant-and-oryzalin-ablation-boundary-crease-depth>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-wound-ring-cmt-circumferential-alignment-cos-2-emerging-on-the-vertex-mesh-wt-stress-cue-vs-oryzalin>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-morphometric-validation-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-morphometric-validation-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.6"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-5-condition-perturbation-morphospace-boundary-depth-pearson-r> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "5-condition perturbation morphospace boundary depth Pearson r = 0.9992 Pearson_r" ;
        dct:description "5-condition p=2.60e-05, RMSE = 0.3213 um (lateral compression clamp depth = 15.69 um)" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Pearson correlation across WT, Strain-cue control, bot1/ktn1, Oryzalin, and Lateral Compression clamp" ;
        schema:name "5-condition perturbation morphospace boundary depth Pearson r" ;
        schema:unitText "Pearson_r" ;
        schema:value "0.9992" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-5-condition-perturbation-morphospace-boundary-depth-pearson-r-reference> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-5-condition-perturbation-morphospace-boundary-depth-pearson-r-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        schema:value "0.998" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-arabidopsis-sam-specimen-saddle-boundary-vs-central-dome-structure-tensor-coherency> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Arabidopsis SAM specimen saddle boundary vs central dome structure-tensor coherency = 0.3659 coherency_index" ;
