    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-measurement-euler-characteristic-residual-chi-after-chi-before-over-all-vertex-mesh-topological-events-divisions-t1> a schema:PropertyValue,
