        schema:measurementTechnique "Per-cell softmax PIN1 allocation on Hookean wall tension vs CMT director slaved to the virial wall-stress tensor; mean over alive cells after 160 steps with divisions (L1VertexTissue.pin1_state / cell_tensors)" ;
        schema:name "Heisler (2010) PIN1-rich wall axis vs CMT director co-alignment <cos^2> on the growing saddle-boundary L1 vertex mesh (WT)" ;
