        schema:measurementTechnique "cos^2 between each new wall and the dividing cell's sigma_1 axis; stress rule applied when cell stress anisotropy > 0.08, else Errera shortest wall. The Errera-only prediction for the same cells is reported in the note (emergent, non-tautological contrast)" ;
